---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Rangliste
permalink: /rangliste/
breadcrumb:
  - label: Rangliste
---
<div class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="page-header__title">Rangliste</h1>
    <p class="page-header__subtitle">Landesrangliste Sachsen – Bogensport</p>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <p>Die aktuellen Ranglisten stehen als PDF-Download zur Verfügung.</p>

    <div style="margin-top: var(--space-xl);">
      {% for ranking in collections.rankings %}
      <a href="{{ ranking.data.file }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="doc-item" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
        <div class="doc-item__icon">PDF</div>
        <div class="doc-item__info">
          <p class="doc-item__title">{{ ranking.data.title }}</p>
          <p class="doc-item__meta">{{ ranking.date | dateFormat }}{% if ranking.data.discipline %} · {{ ranking.data.discipline }}{% endif %} · Saison {{ ranking.data.season }}</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% else %}
      <p>Die Ranglisten werden in Kürze veröffentlicht.</p>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
